#: ../plugins/index.rst:7 739d89c934ea44b6a077f31d1637db82
msgid ":doc:`Plugins documentation <index>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Dokumentacija vtičnikov <index>`"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:13 de09ebe0b3274f1ea77fb78d35195a43
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Vtičniki"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:15 b0505e374b5e4568a184b2431b69f816
msgid ""
"Plugins system allows to extend Galette with specific features that would "
"not be useful for most of the users. Incompatible plugins will automatically "
"be disabled, in which case you should consider upgrading to a more recent "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Sistem vtičnikov omogoča razširitev Galette s specifičnimi funkcijami, ki "
"večini uporabnikov ne bi bile uporabne. Nezdružljivi vtičniki bodo samodejno "
"onemogočeni, v tem primeru pa razmislite o nadgradnji na novejšo različico."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:17 be7b5a0249164e3496dd45bfb9001540
msgid ""
"Each plugin is a simple directory in ``{galette}/plugins/``, then refer to "
"the plugin documentation to install it."
msgstr ""
"Vsak vtičnik je preprost imenik v ``{galette}/plugins/``, nato pa glejte "
"dokumentacijo vtičnika, da ga namestite."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:19 17c41c6c21694038bedfc8e9e178686b
msgid ""
"You can disable a plugin creating a ``_disabled`` file in its directory."
msgstr ""
"Vtičnik lahko onemogočite tako, da v njegovem imeniku ustvarite datoteko "
"``_disabled``."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:23 5483ccea566944c599ae758d421fd0e5
msgid "Official Plugins"
msgstr "Uradni vtičniki"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:25 0a6953be807c4400b0d328d583f7ab12
msgid ""
"Official plugins are developed and maintained by the Galette team. Available "
"official plugins are:"
msgstr ""
"Uradne vtičnike razvija in vzdržuje ekipa Galette. Razpoložljivi uradni "
"vtičniki so:"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:40 85134478955f490288afd16d48644d3c
msgid "Third party plugins"
msgstr "Vtičniki tretjih oseb"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:42 a060f2bb3c9d4b18a63674b599c0eddd
msgid ""
"Third party plugins are developed and maintained by community members. Some "
"of them may not be translated, or available on only one database engine."
msgstr ""
"Vtičnike tretjih oseb razvijajo in vzdržujejo člani skupnosti. Nekateri od "
"njih morda niso prevedeni ali pa so na voljo samo v enem mehanizmu zbirke "
"podatkov."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:44 5bdc8b57cd174cdc811666a9b7b92c80
msgid ""
"`oAuth2 <https://galette-plugins.github.io/plugin-oauth2/>`_ (Galette act as "
"an oAuth2 provider),"
msgstr ""
"`oAuth2 <https://galette-plugins.github.io/plugin-oauth2/>`_ (Galette deluje "
"kot ponudnik oAuth2),"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:45 89dc52c1d8c84ee58016b91d8cca586b
msgid ""
"`Stripe <https://galette-plugins.github.io/plugin-stripe/>`_ (handle `Stripe "
"payments <https://stripe.com/>`_),"
msgstr ""
"`Stripe <https://galette-plugins.github.io/plugin-stripe/>`_ (obravnava "
"`plačila Stripe <https://stripe.com/>`_),"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:46 8f85d9672de34066b16be4eb4c070c9a
msgid ""
"`HelloAsso <https://galette-plugins.github.io/plugin-helloasso/>`_ (handle "
"`HelloAsso payments <https://www.helloasso.com/>`_),"
msgstr ""
"`HelloAsso <https://galette-plugins.github.io/plugin-helloasso/>`_ (handle "
"`HelloAsso payments <https://www.helloasso.com/>`_),"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:47 b93794fdca1d492f93b4dfe653526f87
msgid ""
"`LegalNotices <https://galette-plugins.github.io/plugin-legalnotices/>`_ "
"(manage legal notices pages),"
msgstr ""
"`LegalNotices <https://galette-plugins.github.io/plugin-legalnotices/>`_ "
"(manage legal notices pages),"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:49 856bedd84f9a48a9bdacb389cdf4a971
msgid ""
"A `Github community <https://github.com/galette-plugins/>`_ has been created "
"to :doc:`manage third party plugins <plugins-tiers>`, if you want to add "
"your plugin."
msgstr ""
"Ustvarjena je bila `skupnost Github <https://github.com/galette-plugins/>`_ "
"za :doc:`upravljanje vtičnikov tretjih oseb <plugins-tiers>`, če želite "
"dodati svoj vtičnik."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:60 926b8c8451f04371addb0dd5252e96d0
msgid "Plugins management interface"
msgstr "Vmesnik za upravljanje vtičnikov"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:62 627c7b6977974e358d31c738e5f4e2b3
msgid ""
"A plugins management interface is provided, you will find it from the "
"dashboard or in the configuration menu. After you have downloaded plugin(s) "
"in Galette ``plugins`` directory, a list will be displayed:"
msgstr ""
"Na voljo je vmesnik za upravljanje vtičnikov, ki ga najdete na nadzorni "
"plošči ali v meniju za konfiguracijo. Ko prenesete vtičnike v imenik "
"``plugins`` Galette, se bo prikazal seznam:"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:64 527feb1bfa7a4e5f9e528a918991f792
msgid "Plugins management"
msgstr "Upravljanje vtičnikov"

#: ../plugins/index.rst:69 b18d51ad67bd442c93df555226de9cf1
msgid ""
"If web server has read access to your plugins directory, then you can enable "
"or disable any plugin from the related icon."
msgstr ""
"Če ima spletni strežnik dostop za branje do vašega imenika z vtičniki, lahko "
"kateri koli vtičnik omogočite ali onemogočite s pomočjo ustrezne ikone."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:71 5ea555623bbd44f6abdd245b0a7da95a
msgid ""
"If plugin requires a database to work, you can play installation and update "
"scripts from the interface."
msgstr ""
"Če vtičnik za delovanje potrebuje bazo podatkov, lahko namestitvene in "
"posodobitvene skripte predvajate iz vmesnika."

#: ../plugins/index.rst:73 52bac3cd151342829fc5295b310f78bc
msgid ""
"Database ACLs will then be checked. Unlike Galette, no information will be "
"asked to you, since all is already available from your current instance."
msgstr ""
"Nato bodo preverjeni ACL-ji baze podatkov. Za razliko od Galette vam ne bodo "
"zahtevani nobeni podatki, saj so vsi podatki že na voljo iz vaše trenutne "
"instance."
